// Windows icon resource.
//
// ⚠️ WITHOUT THIS THE EXE HAS NO ICON, AND NEITHER DOES ANYTHING POINTING AT IT.
// SetupIconFile in hamdeck.iss skins the INSTALLER only; Explorer, the taskbar,
// Alt-Tab and every shortcut read the icon from the executable's own resource.
// The artwork existed from the first release and was wired to nothing, so the
// app shipped blank in every one of those places.
//
// ⚠️ IDI_ICON1 must be the LOWEST-numbered icon resource: Windows shows the
// first icon by ordinal for the application, not one picked by name.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "icons/hamdeck.ico"
